OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious conversation' needed
OL,4,Aabout tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "serious conversation" needs to be
OL,7,Fhad about the merits of introducing a
OL,8,Ftourist tax, the leader of Cornwall
OL,9,FCouncil has said.
OL,11,FCouncillor Leigh Frost said it could be
OL,12,Fa way for visitors to contribute to
OL,13,Ffund public services - but did not want
OL,14,Fit to be to the detriment of the
OL,15,Ftourism industry.
OL,17,FOn a recent visit to the area, Prime
OL,18,FMinister Andy Burnham said an overnight
OL,19,Fvisitor levy could be offered to the
OL,20,Fcouncil as part of a devolution deal.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
