OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious conversation' needed
OL,4,Aabout tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in the tourism sector have
OL,7,Fwarned the tax could deter visitors
OL,8,Ffrom coming and so harm the local
OL,9,Feconomy.
